Z||000000||pherder||08-23-2001||04:07 PM||||The below picture (poor second gen copy that I made) is of a 170 mph Fiero powered by a 1500 turbocharged <B>VW RABBIT ENGINE!!!</B><P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads\170_mph_Fiero.jpg">  <P>Picture of the car in the pits @ Bonneville Salt Flats.<P>Dick Martin of Hesperia, CA sent it to me after I answered some questions he had about putting an Isuzu 5 speed and a Quad 4 in this Fiero for a run @ <FONT SIZE="3"><B>200 MPH!!!</B></FONT><P>More info can be gotten from:    <A HREF="mailto:Turboguydm@aol.com">Turboguydm@aol.com</A>  <P>Thought I would share!    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Paul<p>[This message has been edited by pherder (edited 08-23-2001).]||||reg||4
