Z||000003||MinnGreenGT||08-24-2001||09:43 AM||||Someone here in Minn is building an Indy with a SD-4.  From what I understand he's planning on running it at Bonniville- expected 200mph+  Unfortunately, due to the cost of specific parts, he's not going to be done with it for quite some time (est.2-4 years).  Someday!<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/grngtsig3.jpg"> <BR>Medium Metallic Green 87 GT<BR>3.1L High Output<BR>4 Spd OD Tranny<BR>Open (read: Loud) Exhaust<BR>and More!<BR>-Rob Bartlett||||reg||1
